    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so im 34 weeks pregnant and ive noticed my hands and face are looking way more swollen than usual lately. i also keep seeing these weird little flickering lights in my vision every now and then but i figured its just cuz im so exhausted and feeling heavy all the time. is this normal for the end of a pregnancy?",
