      "content": "thanks for letting me know. i'm just really worried about the hospital bills and my insurance is kind of a mess right now. do you think i could just take some ibuprofen or something to help the swelling go down and wait a few days to see if it gets better on its own? i'm feeling okay otherwise besides the tiredness.",
