      "content": "For these specific symptoms in late pregnancy, relying on herbal remedies or over-the-counter supplements is not safe and could mask a serious medical issue. Preeclampsia needs professional diagnosis, not home remedies, especially given your vision changes. Please call your obstetrician's office first thing today; they can advise you on the necessity of an ER visit in a safe and guided manner.",
      "source": "target",
